# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PII FIREWALL - do not relax these without thinking very hard.
#
# The ProPulse registrant export contains real customer names, e-mail addresses
# and phone numbers. None of it may ever enter git history, because git history
# is forever and this repo may become public or be shared with the event team.
#
# Anything dropped in data/ is ignored by default. The ONLY files that may be
# committed from data/ are explicitly re-included at the bottom.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv
*.tsv

# The generated roster still contains visitor names - it is a deploy artefact,
# not source. It gets uploaded to the backend, never committed.
roster.json
roster.*.json

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
aws-credentials*
device-tokens*.json

# Tooling
node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.aws-sam/
cdk.out/

# Re-includes: safe, synthetic sample data only.
!data/sample/
!data/sample/*.csv
